# KHARIS & ALETHEIA — keep the build context (./web, per docker-compose.yml's
# `build.context`) small and the image clean. The old vanilla static site one
# level up is never sent to the Docker daemon in the first place — it sits
# outside this context — so nothing here needs to reference it.
node_modules
.next
out
.git
.gitignore

npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

.DS_Store
*.pem
.env*
!.env.example

README.md
README-DEPLOY.md
CONTRACT-NEXT.md
GATES.md
*.tsbuildinfo
tests
.vscode
.idea
